# Vulnerability details

## Impact
Users can lose all of their funds if they ```rageQuit``` when ```totalVotingPower``` is 0. 
## Proof of Concept
If user rage quits when ```totalVotingPower``` is 0 they can lose all of their funds.

- A new ```party``` is created with a starting ```totalVotingPower``` of 0
- A user calls contribute with ```msg.value = 1 ETH``` and is credited a proportionate voting power.
- After some time he decides that he wants his contribution back. (this happens while contributions are still allowed, ```totalVotingPower``` is only increased when the crowdfund is ```finalized```)
- He calls ```rageQuit``` on the party and sets ```withdrawsTokens = [ETH]```

```solidity
