}
```
- Let's look at the following line of code    
```withdrawAmounts[i] += (balance * getVotingPowerShareOf(tokenIds[j])) / 1e18;```
- The ```getVotingPowerShareOf``` function call will return ```0``` as the ```totalVotingPower``` is 0. So ```balance * 0 / 1e18``` will be set as ```withdrawAmounts[i]``` which evaluates to 0.
